@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Order <<initial>>
state "Order" as Order
state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "Preparation" as Preparation
state "Operations" as Operations
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
state "Withdrawn" as Withdrawn

Order --> Arrival : Delivery / plane is delivered
Arrival --> Preparation : Arrival / prepare for operations or maintenance
Preparation --> Operations : Assignment to Operations / assigned to operations
Preparation --> Maintenance : Assignment to Maintenance / assigned to maintenance
Operations --> Maintenance : No Scheduled Flights / no more scheduled flights
Maintenance --> Preparation : Servicing Complete / serviced and ready for operations

Order --> Withdrawn : Permanent Withdrawal / permanently withdrawn from service
Withdrawn --> [*] : Removed from Operations / removed from operations

@enduml
